8-36961">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36961-36976"><rb>僕</rb><rt>ぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36976-36979">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36979-37003"><rb>歸京</rb><rt>きゝやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37003-37014">する。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37017-37044"><rb>小田原</rb><rt>をだはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37044-37047">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37047-37062"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37062-37065">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37065-37080"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37080-37083">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37083-37098"><rb>僕</rb><rt>ぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37098-37101">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37101-37119"><rb>如何</rb><rt>どん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37119-37122">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37122-37137"><rb>感</rb><rt>かん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37137-37160">があるだらう。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-37160-37199" style="padding-inline-end: 2em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-37190-37199">小山生</seg></p>
      </div>
